    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Line a large, rimmed baking sheet with parchment paper or aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap each cocktail wiener with a piece of bacon; secure with a toothpick. Place bacon-wrapped wieners on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BmE0FpKyBv8cBGG7BjrrHUqVPMo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69919-Bacon-Wrapped-Smokies-PICS-step-02-89832bc7eb4044fa9747b760f98fecc0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69919/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Evenly sprinkle brown sugar over the tops of the bacon-wrapped wieners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X4eLHtpcUtWD-Vs9q2MJI9d_Djw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69919-Bacon-Wrapped-Smokies-PICS-step-03-a060b2c6d2a74ddab1e5fac1b610c6a8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69919/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until bacon is crisp and sugar is bubbly, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0ugJhzDdqEOP0HHGNPgxTIu8W0c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/69919-Bacon-Wrapped-Smokies-PICS-step-04-e73f65ffe27743ac80574b0eca3ea3ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/69919/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
